                "apprentice": "The sandstorm intensifies, creating a larger zone of abrasive particles that damages opponents' equipment and obscures their vision. The Knight can use the sandstorm to cover repositioning and prevent opponents from tracking their blade angles. The abrasive particles also degrade opponents' equipment over time.\n\nA close-quarters specialist with this enhancement operates at a meaningful advantage in abrasive wind slashes that degrade armor with every strike. The Knight fights on ground they have shaped — stone walls channel opponents toward the blade, spikes create kill zones, and the ground itself becomes a weapon.",
