                "master": "sandstorm operates at the peak of melee enhancement — the Knight's close-quarters capability is dramatically elevated. The Knight creates a devastating abrasive cloud that blinds, degrades, and suffocates opponents throughout the melee area. The Knight alone fights effectively within the storm — their blade an unseen threat that opponents cannot track or predict in the howling sand.\n\nThe abrasive wind slashes that degrade armor with every strike this provides changes the fundamental rhythm of blade-work. Each blow flows more efficiently, and the cumulative effect across a full engagement is extraordinary."
