                "adept": "Professional-grade combat blessing for melee operations. The Knight bestows devastating blessings that dramatically enhance blade-work for themselves and nearby allies. Blessed fighters strike faster, parry more precisely, and sustain longer. The Knight can maintain blessings through extended melee, creating a formation of enhanced warriors.\n\nThe enhancement to enhanced combat capability from targeted spiritual empowerment transforms the fighter's approach to hand-to-hand range. What begins as a pronounced advantage in isolated blows becomes a systemic shift across the entire engagement.",
                "expert": "The Knight's combat blessings approach the practical ceiling of melee enhancement. Every blessed ally fights at significantly enhanced capability — their blade-work is faster, more precise, and more sustained. The Knight can bless an entire melee formation, creating a unit of devastatingly effective close-quarters fighters.\n\nThis improvement to enhanced combat capability from targeted spiritual empowerment adds tactical depth to every exchange within the clinch. The blade-fighter gains options that unenhanced practitioners simply do not have, and each additional option represents a dramatic expansion of their combat repertoire.",
                "master": "The combat blessings operate at the spell's theoretical maximum for melee combat. The Knight bestows devastating enhancements that make every blessed ally significantly more effective in close quarters. The Knight is a walking enhancement — their presence in melee elevates the entire formation, making every ally a more dangerous fighter.\n\nThe Knight in the press of melee There is no physical strike without abstract consequence, and no abstract attack without physical manifestation."
