                "expert": "The Knight's blade spirit summoning approaches the practical ceiling of melee support. Multiple powerful spectral weapons fight alongside the Knight, creating a wall of steel that opponents cannot defend against. The Knight and their summoned spirits fight with perfect coordination, overwhelming any single opponent through sheer numbers.\n\nThe returns from allied constructs that flank and overwhelm in close quarters scale progressively through sustained close-quarters fighting. An early decisive edge widens as the engagement continues, and the fighter who endures longest dictates most completely.",
                "master": "blade spirit summoning reaches its combat apex, and the Knight's blade-work benefits from maximum augmentation. The Knight summons devastating spectral weapons that fight with perfect coordination alongside the physical blade. The Knight is a one-person army in close quarters — their summoned spirits create a wall of steel that no opponent can survive alone.\n\nThe enhancement to allied constructs that flank and overwhelm in close quarters transforms the fighter's approach to hand-to-hand range. What begins as a transcendent advantage in isolated strikes becomes a systemic shift across the entire engagement."
