                "expert": "The Knight's banishment approaches the practical ceiling of melee area control. The Knight can banish virtually any summoned entity from the combat area, clearing the field for pure close-quarters fighting. No summoner can maintain their creations in the Knight's melee presence — the fight is always on the Knight's terms.\n\nThe counter-summoning that clears the melee of hostile entities this provides changes the fundamental rhythm of blade-work. Each strike flows more efficiently, and the cumulative effect across a full engagement is dramatic.",
                "master": "The Knight who has fully mastered banishment fights at the height of close-quarters capability. The Knight can banish any summoned entity from the combat area, ensuring that close-quarters engagements are always a contest of blade skill. The Knight is a walking null-zone for summoned entities — their melee presence clears the field for pure fighting.\n\nThe enhancement to counter-summoning that clears the melee of hostile entities transforms the fighter's approach to hand-to-hand range. What begins as a transcendent advantage in isolated exchanges becomes a systemic shift across the entire engagement."
