                "adept": "Professional-grade necromantic support for melee operations. The Knight animates powerful undead allies that fight effectively alongside the Knight in close quarters. The spectral warriors absorb attacks, create openings, and deliver their own strikes. The Knight fights as the center of a growing formation of undead warriors.\n\nThe pronounced improvement in death-attuned blade-work that grows stronger as opponents fall reshapes how the fighter approaches the melee. Every exchange reinforces the combatant establishes advantage that accumulates across each support cycle strikes.",
