                "master": "In the Knight's hands, combat empathy reaches the pinnacle of close-quarters application. The Knight reads opponents' emotional states with absolute clarity, understanding their fighting psychology completely. The Knight is a master of the psychological blade — their strikes land at the moment of maximum emotional vulnerability, making every exchange a masterclass in psychological warfare.\n\nFrom a tactical perspective, the peak improvement in close-quarters capability is clear and measurable. The combatant who masters this enhancement dominates the melee."
