                "master": "Duelist's Fate operates at the peak of melee enhancement — the Knight's close-quarters capability is dramatically elevated. The Knight influences combat probability with devastating consistency, ensuring critical outcomes always favor the Knight. The Knight is fate's chosen duelist — their blade connects, their parries hold, and their strikes find their mark with a consistency that transcends luck.\n\nThe paramount gains in probability-shifted blade-work where every cut finds its mark Each exchange builds on the last, and the fighter who takes the lead early dictates the pace of the fight."
