                "apprentice": "The conceptual enhancement intensifies, allowing the Knight to apply the concept of \"unstoppable force\" to their strikes. Parries that should deflect the blade merely slow it, and armor that should stop it merely resists. The Knight's blade carries conceptual weight that transcends physical limitations.\n\nThe significant improvement in concept-striking blade-work that targets what an opponent represents reshapes how the fighter approaches the melee. Every exchange reinforces the combatant establishes advantage that accumulates across each support cycle strikes.",
