                "master": "Full mastery of conceptual magic transforms the Knight into a devastating melee force. The Knight applies devastating conceptual enhancements to their blade-work that transcend physical limitations. The Knight is a conceptual weapon — their blade carries the concept of \"inevitable strike\" and their defense carries the concept of \"impenetrable guard,\" making them a force of nature in close quarters.\n\nFrom a tactical perspective, the peak improvement in concept-striking blade-work that targets what an opponent represents is clear and measurable. The close-quarters specialist who masters this enhancement presses the melee with firm command of engagement pace of every engagement."
