                "beginner": "The Knight creates a Severing Lock — a spatial anchor that prevents opponents from teleporting or using spatial manipulation within the Knight's melee range. At this level, the lock is weak and can be overcome by powerful spatial magic, but it provides basic protection against teleportation-based escape from melee.\n\nThe tangible enhancement to locking opponents in place for guaranteed blade strikes The Knight's edge turns a desperate parry into a winning riposte when an opponent's blade is a hair's breadth from landing.",
