                "adept": "Professional-grade spatial lock for melee operations. The Knight creates a powerful Severing Lock that prevents all teleportation and spatial manipulation within their melee range. No opponent can escape the Knight's blade through dimensional tricks — the fight stays physical, and in physical combat, the Knight excels.\n\nOpponents who face this enhancement quickly recognize the clear difference in locking opponents in place for guaranteed blade strikes. The combatant who internalizes this advantage seizes the clinch with growing confidence.",
