                "expert": "The Knight's Silencing Strike approaches the practical ceiling of melee magic suppression. The blade carries nullifying force that disrupts all magical activity in the struck target. The Knight becomes a walking anti-mage — their blade makes spellcasting impossible in close quarters, forcing opponents to fight physically where the Knight dominates.\n\nThe returns from suppression strikes that strip magical enhancement from opponents in melee scale progressively through sustained close-quarters fighting. An early decisive edge widens as the engagement continues, and the fighter who endures longest dominates most completely.",
                "master": "With Silencing Strike fully realized, the Knight's melee effectiveness approaches its practical ceiling. The Knight's blade carries devastating nullifying force that makes spellcasting impossible for anyone they strike. The Knight is a walking anti-mage — their melee range is a null-zone for magical activity, forcing all combat into the physical domain where the Knight reigns supreme.\n\nThe suppression strikes that strip magical enhancement from opponents in melee this provides changes the fundamental rhythm of blade-work. Each exchange flows more efficiently, and the cumulative effect across a full engagement is extraordinary."
