                "apprentice": "The Mana Sacrifice becomes more efficient, allowing the Knight to transfer meaningful mana at reduced personal cost. The Knight can sacrifice mana to fuel enhanced blade techniques when their device's reserves run dry, or transfer reserves to critically depleted allies. The sacrifice is still costly but less debilitating.\n\nFrom a tactical perspective, the significant improvement in mana-sharing that sustains the Knight's enhanced blade-work through extended melee is clear and measurable. The combatant who masters this enhancement dominates the melee.",
