                "expert": "The Knight's Mana Sacrifice approaches the practical ceiling of combat mana transfer. The Knight can efficiently sacrifice personal mana to fuel devastating enhanced techniques or replenish critically depleted allies. The sacrifice ensures the Knight always has one more fight left, even when conventional mana management says they should be empty.\n\nThis improvement to mana-sharing that sustains the Knight's enhanced blade-work through extended melee adds tactical depth to every exchange within the clinch. The blade-fighter gains options that unenhanced practitioners simply do not have, and each additional option represents a dramatic expansion of their combat repertoire.",
                "master": "Mana Sacrifice operates at the highest practical level of close-quarters augmentation. The Knight can sacrifice personal mana with devastating efficiency to fuel enhanced techniques or replenish allies. The Knight is a warrior who always has one more fight in them — their willingness to sacrifice ensures the blade never stops, the ally never falls, and the melee never ends while the Knight still draws breath.\n\nThe mana-sharing that sustains the Knight's enhanced blade-work through extended melee this provides changes the fundamental rhythm of blade-work. Each strike flows more efficiently, and the cumulative effect across a full engagement is extraordinary."
