                "apprentice": "The probability manipulation intensifies, allowing the Knight to more dramatically influence the likelihood of combat outcomes. Critical strikes that should miss connect, and desperate parries that should fail hold. The Knight becomes remarkably fortunate in melee, with probability consistently favoring their blade.\n\nThe considerable enhancement to unlikely blade-strikes that land with impossible consistency The Knight's edge turns a desperate parry into a winning riposte when an opponent's blade is a hair's breadth from landing.",
