                "expert": "The Knight's probability control approaches the practical ceiling of melee probability manipulation. The Knight can ensure that critical combat outcomes fall in their favor with remarkable consistency. Probability itself becomes the Knight's ally in close quarters — their strikes find openings that shouldn't exist and their defenses hold against attacks that should break them.\n\nThe overwhelming improvement in unlikely blade-strikes that land with impossible consistency reshapes how the blade-fighter approaches the melee. Every exchange reinforces the close-quarters specialist establishes advantage that accumulates across each support cycle strikes.",
                "master": "Mastery of probability manipulation elevates the Knight's melee to its most formidable expression. The Knight influences combat probability with devastating consistency, making the unlikely routine and the impossible merely improbable. The Knight is fate's favored duelist — probability bends toward their blade, making them remarkably difficult to defeat in close quarters where every exchange is influenced by the Knight's probability control.\n\nThe returns from unlikely blade-strikes that land with impossible consistency scale progressively through sustained close-quarters fighting. An early unmatched edge widens as the engagement continues, and the blade-fighter who endures longest dictates most completely."
