                "master": "The Bombardment mage's adrenal system is permanently optimized for combat. Every moment is peak firing readiness. The mage fires with maximum aggression and minimum waste, their body a perfectly calibrated artillery platform that never tires, never hesitates, and never holds back.\n\nA ranged specialist with this enhancement operates at a decisive edge in burst-fire sequences that overwhelm defenses. Where an unaugmented bombardment platform must account for limitations, the enhanced mage treats artillery operations as the formation anchor maintains healing coverage even under direct pressure."
