                "expert": "The bond approaches its theoretical maximum. The weapon is a true extension of the Bombardment mage's will — it fires as thought fires, with no perceptible delay between intention and bombardment. The mage can manipulate the weapon remotely with fine control, and the bond extends to all firing configurations.\n\nA ranged specialist with this enhancement operates at a decisive advantage in device-weapon synergy that improves accuracy. Where an unaugmented bombardment platform must account for limitations, the enhanced mage treats artillery operations as the formation anchor maintains healing coverage even under direct pressure.",
                "master": "The Ordnance Bond is complete. Bombardment mage and weapon are one — the cannon is as natural as a limb, as responsive as a thought, and as reliable as the mage's own heartbeat. The weapon can be reconfigured mid-combat through the bond, and the mage fires with absolute certainty that their aim will be exactly where it needs to be.\n\nA bombardment platform with this enhancement operates at a decisive edge in device-weapon synergy that improves accuracy. Where an unaugmented ranged specialist must account for limitations, the enhanced mage treats artillery operations as the formation anchor maintains healing coverage even under direct pressure."
