                "master": "The Bombardment mage absorbs concussive and blast force with near-optimal efficiency. Counter-battery fire that would incapacitate unaugmented artillery crews is shrugged off, and the mage can sustain extended bombardment operations with minimal concern for cumulative blast damage. The spell operates permanently.\n\nThe peerless enhancement to withstanding return fire while maintaining bombardment converts battlefield ambiguity into actionable support decisions. In fire-direction, the bombardment platform who can rely on this advantage makes decisions faster and commits with greater conviction than any opponent who must second-guess."
