                "master": "Kinetic amplification at this level represents the zenith of bombardment-enhanced combat magic. Every bombardment shot carries force far beyond what the base spell should generate. The mage delivers devastating impact at any range their bombardment reaches. Each shot reshapes the engagement on contact — fortifications crumble, cover becomes meaningless, and the Kinetic Shelling mage defines the battlefield.\n\nFrom a tactical perspective, the peak improvement in amplified projectile force at range is clear and measurable. The bombardment platform who masters this enhancement dominates ranged combat with firm command of engagement pace of every barrage."
