                "master": "The Bombardment mage's body adapts to artillery combat at the spell's theoretical maximum. Every engagement permanently refines the mage's physical form for bombardment excellence. The Gunner's Perfection mage who has fired every type of configuration becomes physically optimized for every type of bombardment.\n\nThe peak improvement in physique that adjusts to each ranged engagement reshapes how the fire-support approaches ranged combat. The ranged engagement shifts as the bombardment platform establishes fire-superiority that accumulates across each support cycle volleys."
