                "apprentice": "Reflexive dodges become more sophisticated, incorporating tactical repositioning and firing stance maintenance. The Bombardment mage's body shifts to evade incoming counter-battery while preserving targeting data for immediate return fire. The device triggers the dodge before conscious awareness of the threat.\n\nThe automatic evasion of counter-battery fire this provides changes the fundamental rhythm of fire-direction. Each engagement flows more efficiently, and the cumulative effect across a full engagement is marked.",
