                "expert": "The Bombardment mage's reflexive dodges approach the practical ceiling of artillery evasion. Every incoming counter-battery attack is met with the optimal evasive response — minimal movement, maximum effectiveness, immediate return-fire position. The mage dodges as efficiently as they fire, wasting no motion and losing no targeting data.\n\nFrom a tactical perspective, the overwhelming improvement in automatic evasion of counter-battery fire is clear and measurable. The ranged specialist who masters this enhancement outranges ranged combat with firm command of engagement pace of every fire-mission.",
