                "beginner": "The Bombardment mage fires a Target Lock — a ranged projectile that prevents teleportation and spatial manipulation within the impact area. At this level, the lock is weak and can be overcome by powerful spatial magic, but it provides basic protection against teleportation-based evasion from bombardment.\n\nA bombardment platform with this enhancement operates at a measurable advantage in spatial restriction that prevents enemy evasion of artillery. Where an unaugmented ranged specialist must account for limitations, the enhanced mage treats artillery operations as the formation anchor maintains healing coverage even under direct pressure.",
                "apprentice": "The Target Lock intensifies, preventing most teleportation and spatial manipulation within the bombardment area. Opponents cannot blink away from the Bombardment mage's fire, cannot phase through the bombardment, and cannot use spatial tricks to escape. The lock ensures the bombardment area remains inescapable.\n\nThe enhancement to spatial restriction that prevents enemy evasion of artillery transforms the artillery mage's approach to long-range fighting. What begins as a significant advantage in isolated salvos becomes a systemic shift across the entire engagement.",
                "adept": "Professional-grade spatial lock for artillery operations. The Bombardment mage fires powerful Target Lock rounds that prevent all teleportation and spatial manipulation within the impact area. No opponent can escape the Bombardment mage's fire through dimensional tricks — the engagement area stays physical, and in physical bombardment, the Bombardment mage excels.\n\nThe enhancement to long-range capability transforms the fire-support's approach to long-range fighting. What begins as a pronounced advantage in isolated volleys becomes a systemic shift across the entire engagement.",
                "expert": "The Bombardment mage's Target Lock approaches the practical ceiling of ranged spatial control. No teleportation, dimensional shifting, or spatial manipulation can function within the bombardment area. The Bombardment mage creates zones where only physical movement matters — and in those zones, bombardment is supreme.\n\nThe overwhelming improvement in long-range capability reshapes how the fire-support approaches ranged combat. Each volley demonstrates the bombardment platform establishes fire-superiority that accumulates across each support cycle engagements.",
                "master": "Target Lock at this level represents the zenith of bombardment-enhanced combat magic. The Bombardment mage fires devastating spatial lock rounds that make their bombardment area a null-zone for all dimensional and spatial magic. No opponent can escape, no teleportation works, and the bombardment stays inescapable within the Target Lock zone.\n\nA ranged specialist with this enhancement operates at a decisive edge in spatial restriction that prevents enemy evasion of artillery. Where an unaugmented bombardment platform must account for limitations, the enhanced mage treats artillery operations as the formation anchor maintains healing coverage even under direct pressure."
