                "master": "With Jamming Shell fully realized, the Bombardment mage's artillery effectiveness approaches its practical ceiling. The Bombardment mage fires devastating nullification rounds that make spellcasting impossible in the impact area. The mage is a walking anti-mage — their bombardment area is a null-zone for magical activity, forcing all combat into the physical domain where the Bombardment mage reigns supreme.\n\nThe returns from anti-magic bombardment that silences enemy casters at range scale progressively through sustained artillery operations. An early unmatched edge widens as the engagement continues, and the artillery mage who endures longest commands most completely."
