                "expert": "The Bombardment mage's probability control approaches the practical ceiling of bombardment probability manipulation. The mage can ensure that critical bombardment outcomes fall in their favor with remarkable consistency. Probability itself becomes the Bombardment mage's ally — their rounds find openings that shouldn't exist and their targeting works against attacks that should break it.\n\nThe overwhelming improvement in probability-biased trajectories that find gaps in any defense reshapes how the fire-support approaches ranged combat. The ranged engagement shifts as the bombardment platform establishes fire-superiority that accumulates across each support cycle volleys.",
                "master": "Mastery of probability manipulation elevates the Bombardment mage's fire to its most formidable expression. The Bombardment mage influences combat probability with devastating consistency, making the unlikely routine and the impossible merely improbable. The mage is fate's favored artillery — probability bends toward their fire, making them remarkably difficult to defeat in ranged combat where every exchange is influenced by the Bombardment mage's probability control.\n\nThe enhancement to probability-biased trajectories that find gaps in any defense transforms the fire-support's approach to long-range fighting. What begins as a transcendent advantage in isolated engagements becomes a systemic shift across the entire engagement."
