                "expert": "The Bombardment mage's causal control approaches the practical ceiling of bombardment causality manipulation. The mage can ensure that their bombardment always precedes the target's evasion in the causal chain, making their fire effectively inevitable. The technique makes the Bombardment mage's fire the first and final word in any engagement — cause and effect bend toward the Bombardment mage's bombardment.\n\nThe enhancement to causal artillery where the impact precedes the firing command transforms the artillery mage's approach to long-range fighting. What begins as a overwhelming advantage in isolated volleys becomes a systemic shift across the entire engagement.",
                "master": "In the Bombardment mage's hands, causality manipulation reaches the pinnacle of ranged application. The Bombardment mage influences the causal chain of engagement with devastating effectiveness, ensuring their fire always precedes the target's evasion. The Bombardment mage's bombardment is the first cause in any engagement — the target can only react to fire that has already been destined to connect.\n\nThe peak improvement in causal artillery where the impact precedes the firing command reshapes how the artillery mage approaches ranged combat. Each volley demonstrates the ranged specialist establishes fire-superiority that accumulates across each support cycle engagements."
