                "expert": "The Thaumaturge can maintain peak support performance for roughly a week with minimal rest. The device manages all biological needs, drawing supplemental energy from ambient mana when caloric reserves run dry. Extended campaigns, week-long medical operations, and back-to-back support rotations are all viable. The Thaumaturge simply does not stop unless they choose to.\n\nThe substantial gains in supporting the formation through protracted operations create building advantage that compounds rapidly. Each successful ward rotation in sustained engagements makes the next one easier, and the coordination hub who seizes the initiative early fortifies the engagement from that point forward.",
                "master": "Operational endurance approaches the practical ceiling of what a Thaumaturge's body and device can sustain. The mage can maintain peak support performance indefinitely while mana holds, with no meaningful degradation in healing precision, buff timing, or triage accuracy. Extended operations that would exhaust entire medical teams become routine. The Thaumaturge is the last one supporting — always.\n\nFrom a tactical perspective, the peak improvement in supporting the formation through protracted operations is clear and measurable. The support mage who masters this enhancement sustains support operations with firm command of engagement pace of every healing pulse."
