                "expert": "The Thaumaturge's support effects carry overwhelming force — buffs that resist dispelling, heals that close grievous wounds, barriers that hold against significant assault. The device modulates the amplification with surgical precision, allowing the mage to deliver exactly the support needed.\n\nFrom a tactical perspective, the overwhelming improvement in amplified healing pulses that strengthen the formation is clear and measurable. The support mage who masters this enhancement anchors support operations with firm command of engagement pace of every healing pulse.",
                "master": "Kinetic amplification at this level represents the zenith of support-enhanced combat magic. Every buff carries force far beyond what the base spell should generate, every heal closes wounds at remarkable speed, and every protective effect holds with extraordinary resilience. The Thaumaturge's support defines the engagement — their Redirected Force makes every ally significantly harder to defeat.\n\nThe paramount gains in amplified healing pulses that strengthen the formation create building advantage that compounds rapidly. Each successful ward rotation in sustained engagements makes the next one easier, and the coordination hub who seizes the initiative early reinforces the engagement from that point forward."
