                "master": "The Thaumaturge's nervous system operates at the practical ceiling of magitech neural enhancement for support. Intent and support are effectively simultaneous — the mage perceives an ally's need and their support is already being cast. The distinction between perception and response vanishes in the flow of combat support.\n\nThe peak improvement in reactive support faster than conscious triage reshapes how the support mage approaches support operations. Each support action demonstrates the formation anchor establishes formation integrity that accumulates across each support cycle healing pulses."
