                "master": "Blood manipulation reaches its support apex, and the Thaumaturge's healing benefits from maximum augmentation. The Thaumaturge's circulatory control extends to both themselves and nearby allies — wounds seal almost instantly, blood pressure remains stable through any trauma, and the mage can sustain support operations regardless of personal or allied injury. The ultimate field medic whose control over life's vital fluid saves lives as surely as any healing spell.\n\nFrom a tactical perspective, the peak improvement in blood as a resource for extended support delivery is clear and measurable. The support mage who masters this enhancement sustains support operations with firm command of engagement pace of every healing pulse."
