                "master": "Ward Deflection operates at the highest practical level of support augmentation. The Thaumaturge's body evades incoming attacks with near-zero latency and near-zero wasted motion. Every dodge flows into an optimal support position, and the mage operates with the certainty that threats will be evaded while support continues uninterrupted.\n\nAllies who receive this support quickly benefit from the extraordinary difference in instinctive avoidance while maintaining support. The triage specialist who internalizes this advantage fortifies the healing rotation with growing confidence."
