                "master": "Mastery of Support Synchronization elevates the Thaumaturge's support to its most formidable expression. The Thaumaturge creates a team that functions as a single supported unit — every member aware of every other's status, every support need addressed at the right moment, every defensive action coordinated through shared awareness. The mage leads this formation with perfect synchronization, making their team extremely difficult to defeat through attrition.\n\nThe peak improvement in seamless formation coordination for unified support reshapes how the support mage approaches support operations. The formation holds stronger as the formation anchor establishes formation integrity that accumulates across each support cycle healing pulses."
