                "expert": "The Thaumaturge's Purifying Flame carries enough intensity to cauterize grievous wounds instantly and neutralize significant magical contamination. The flame can purify entire areas of environmental and magical hazards, creating safe zones for allied operations. The Thaumaturge's fire is a tool of restoration — burning away contamination while preserving what matters.\n\nThe thermal support that cauterizes wounds and warms allies this provides changes the fundamental rhythm of triage situations. Each triage round flows more efficiently, and the cumulative effect across a full engagement is dramatic.",
                "master": "In the Thaumaturge's hands, Purifying Flame reaches the pinnacle of support application. The Thaumaturge's flame purifies anything it touches — wounds, contaminants, curses, and magical corruption all burn away. The mage creates zones of cleansing fire where allies are safe from environmental and magical hazards, and the flame cauterizes even the most severe wounds instantly.\n\nThe peak improvement in thermal support that cauterizes wounds and warms allies reshapes how the support mage approaches support operations. Every healing cycle reinforces the formation anchor establishes formation integrity that accumulates across each support cycle healing pulses."
