                "master": "At this level, Medicinal Frost is the Thaumaturge's healing made manifest — support and spell are indistinguishable. The Thaumaturge's frost provides perfect anesthetic, eliminates inflammation, and can preserve critically wounded allies in suspended animation indefinitely. The mage is a walking medical freezer — their frost keeps allies alive until they can be properly healed, making death from blood loss a preventable condition.\n\nA formation anchor with this enhancement operates at a decisive edge in cold-based triage that reduces inflammation and preserves tissue. Where an unaugmented triage specialist must account for limitations, the enhanced mage treats formation fighting as the formation anchor maintains healing coverage even under direct pressure."
