                "expert": "The Thaumaturge's Preserving Frost carries enough intensity to preserve any ally in suspended animation indefinitely, seal any wound, and create perfect conditions for field surgery. The frost can freeze an entire area sterile, making even the most contaminated environment suitable for medical operations. The ultimate triage tool for preserving life until healing is available.\n\nThis improvement to healing capability adds tactical depth to every formation adjustment within the healing rotation. The triage specialist gains options that unenhanced practitioners simply do not have, and each additional option represents a dramatic expansion of their combat repertoire.",
