                "expert": "The Thaumaturge's Protective Cage creates a comprehensive defensive perimeter that makes the formation nearly extremely difficult to assault directly. The electrical field deters any approach, and allies within receive continuous revitalization. The mage creates a protected sanctuary where the squad can operate, heal, and recover without fear of direct assault.\n\nThe returns from support capability scale progressively through sustained formation fighting. An early decisive edge widens as the engagement continues, and the formation anchor who endures longest stabilizes most completely.",
                "master": "Mastery of Protective Cage elevates the Thaumaturge's support to its most formidable expression. The Thaumaturge creates a comprehensive defensive perimeter that makes the formation impervious to direct assault while providing continuous revitalization to all allies within. The mage is a walking sanctuary — their cage protects the squad and keeps them fighting at peak capacity, making the formation extremely difficult to defeat through conventional assault.\n\nThe returns from support capability scale progressively through sustained formation fighting. An early unmatched edge widens as the engagement continues, and the formation anchor who endures longest sustains most completely."
