                "adept": "Professional-grade astral support for healing operations. The Thaumaturge projects capable healing spirits that deliver comprehensive support to distant allies. The spirits can heal wounds, maintain buffs, and provide emergency stabilization to any teammate in range. The Thaumaturge can project multiple spirits simultaneously, supporting the entire formation from the back line.\n\nThis improvement to projected support presence that extends healing beyond physical range adds tactical depth to every formation adjustment within the healing rotation. The triage specialist gains options that unenhanced practitioners simply do not have, and each additional option represents a clear expansion of their combat repertoire.",
                "expert": "The Thaumaturge's astral support approaches the practical ceiling of ranged healing. The mage can project powerful healing spirits that deliver comprehensive support to every ally in range simultaneously. The spirits heal wounds, maintain buffs, and provide emergency stabilization wherever needed. The Thaumaturge is a walking support network — their spirits ensure every ally receives attention.\n\nThe returns from projected support presence that extends healing beyond physical range scale progressively through sustained formation fighting. An early decisive edge widens as the engagement continues, and the formation anchor who endures longest anchors most completely.",
                "master": "astral support operates at the highest practical level of support augmentation. The Thaumaturge projects devastating healing spirits that deliver comprehensive support to every ally in range simultaneously. The mage is a walking support network — their spirits ensure every ally receives healing, buffs, and stabilization regardless of distance or physical barriers.\n\nThis improvement to projected support presence that extends healing beyond physical range adds tactical depth to every formation adjustment within the healing rotation. The triage specialist gains options that unenhanced practitioners simply do not have, and each additional option represents a extraordinary expansion of their combat repertoire."
