                "expert": "The Thaumaturge's soul sight approaches the practical ceiling of support spiritual perception. Every ally's spiritual state is clearly readable, and the Thaumaturge exploits every insight to deliver optimally targeted support. The Thaumaturge fights with the certainty of someone who knows exactly which ally needs what — and they deliver it with remarkable precision.\n\nThe support capability this provides changes the fundamental rhythm of triage situations. Each triage round flows more efficiently, and the cumulative effect across a full engagement is dramatic.",
                "master": "Mastery of soul sight elevates the Thaumaturge's support to its most formidable expression. The Thaumaturge perceives the complete spiritual essence of every ally — their physical condition, mana reserves, emotional state, and combat readiness are all visible with absolute clarity. The mage is a walking diagnostic system — their soul sight ensures every support action is optimally targeted and maximally effective.\n\nThe support capability this provides changes the fundamental rhythm of triage situations. Each triage round flows more efficiently, and the cumulative effect across a full engagement is extraordinary."
