                "expert": "The Thaumaturge's reality anchor approaches the practical ceiling of support spatial resistance. The mage is effectively immune to all forms of spatial manipulation and dimensional displacement. No teleportation, no spatial distortion, no dimensional attack can separate the Thaumaturge from the formation they are protecting.\n\nThe support capability this provides changes the fundamental rhythm of triage situations. Each triage round flows more efficiently, and the cumulative effect across a full engagement is dramatic.",
